Norm grew up as a competitive swimmer, with long hours doing laps in the pool. His
swimming career peaked in university with a trip to US Division III Nationals. An
injury prevented his return during his last year, so he knows the darkness is dealing
with a body that has failed.

He isn't here to oversee the way you train in any particular sport, but is here to work
on your mind, to build the mental fortitude and resiliance to handle the pressure of
the big moments and difficult choices, but also to be able to always choose consistently
in line with who you want to be in every moment.



